### 다배움 API 테스트 (REST Client)
### 인증/가입/재설정/공개 검증은 IP별 초과 시 429 RATE_LIMITED + Retry-After(초)
### 강좌 첨부 본문은 Bearer 필요. 게시된 공지 첨부 본문은 공개.
### 기존 INQUIRY 파일은 업로더만 조회 가능하며 새 INQUIRY 업로드는 거부.
### Spec: http://<API_SERVER>:8080/openapi/dabaeum-api-v1.yaml
### Swagger: http://<API_SERVER>:8080/swagger-ui/index.html#/
### Local copy: apitest/dabaeum-api-v1.yaml

@baseUrl = http://<API_SERVER>:8080/api/v1
@token = <YOUR_TOKEN>
@institutionId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@userId = 31b19a98-1982-45a4-96d1-3903856d0c77
@courseId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003
@sessionId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004
@enrollmentId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000005
@attendanceId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000006
@completionId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000007
@credentialId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000008
@identityId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000009
@roleId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000010
@badgeId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000011
@applicationId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000012
@idempotencyKey = test-idempotency-key-001

### =========================
### System
### =========================

### 시스템 상태 확인 (인증 불필요)
GET {{baseUrl}}/system/ping
Accept: application/json

### =========================
### Institution
### =========================

### 기관 목록 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/institutions?page=0&size=20&sort=createdAt,desc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 기관 생성
POST {{baseUrl}}/institutions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "institutionCode": "SEOUL-LLC-001",
  "name": "서울평생교육원",
  "businessNumber": "123-45-67890",
  "representativeName": "김대표",
  "address": "서울특별시 중구 세종대로 110",
  "contactPhone": "02-1234-5678",
  "contactEmail": "contact@seoul-llc.example",
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### 기관 상세 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/institutions/{{institutionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 기관 수정
PUT {{baseUrl}}/institutions/{{institutionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "contactPhone": "02-1234-5679",
  "contactEmail": "contact@seoul-llc.example",
  "introduction": "기관 소개",
  "logoFileId": null
}

### =========================
### Auth / User
### =========================

### 현재 인증 세션 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/session
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 강사·기관 관리자 이메일 회원가입 — agreedToUsage·agreedToPrivacy 필수(없으면 400/422), 마케팅 선택. 구·군은 #142 에서 없앴다
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "learner@example.com",
  "password": "password12",
  "name": "홍길동",
  "phone": "010-1234-5678",
  "agreedToUsage": true,
  "agreedToPrivacy": true,
  "agreedToMarketing": false
}

### 일반 로그인 — 5회 연속 실패 → 30분 잠금. 5번째 실패·잠긴 동안은 401 code=ACCOUNT_LOCKED (비밀번호가 맞아도)
### 응답 data.session.passwordExpired: 관리자 비밀번호 90일 경과·임시 비밀번호면 true
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "learner@example.com",
  "password": "password12"
}

### 관리자 목록 (PLATFORM_ADMIN) — q: 이름·이메일 부분일치
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/administrators?page=0&size=20&role=INSTITUTION_ADMIN&status=ACTIVE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 관리자 생성 (PLATFORM_ADMIN) — data.temporaryPassword 는 이 응답에서만. 409 이메일 중복·404 기관 없음·503 학번 소진
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/administrators
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "기관관리자",
  "email": "inst-admin@example.com",
  "role": "INSTITUTION_ADMIN",
  "institutionId": "{{institutionId}}"
}

### 관리자 접속기록 (PLATFORM_ADMIN) — from·to 서울 날짜, 둘 다 포함
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/access-logs?page=0&size=20&action=READ&from=2026-09-22&to=2026-09-28
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 다대구 QR 로그인 설정 (siteId, 인증 없음 · local/dev 전용)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/dadaegu/config
Accept: application/json

### 다대구 DID 로그인 — didLogin.js 콜백 암호문을 그대로 (복호화 실패·비활성 = 401)
### 항상 200. 처음 보는 DID 면 data.registrationRequired=true + registrationToken(10분·1회용)·maskedName
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/dadaegu/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "did": "<Base64 암호문>",
  "name": "<Base64 암호문>",
  "birthdate": "<Base64 암호문>",
  "phoneNumber": "<Base64 암호문>"
}

### 다대구 첫 로그인 가입 완료 — 201 토큰 응답. 만료·재사용 401, 동시 가입 409
# interestCodes 선택 0~3개(GET /course-classifications 1단계). 값이 있으면 agreedToInterest true 필수, 아니면 422 VALIDATION_FAILED (#142)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/dadaegu/signup
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "registrationToken": "<dadaegu/login 응답의 registrationToken>",
  "interestCodes": ["TSIX_040000", "TSIX_050000"],
  "agreedToInterest": true,
  "agreedToUsage": true,
  "agreedToPrivacy": true,
  "agreedToMarketing": false
}

### =========================
### Instructor Applications
### =========================

### 기관 강사 신청
POST {{baseUrl}}/institutions/{{institutionId}}/instructor-applications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "applicationMessage": "해당 분야 강의 경력이 있습니다."
}

### 기관 강사 신청 목록
GET {{baseUrl}}/institutions/{{institutionId}}/instructor-applications?page=0&size=20&status=PENDING
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 내 강사 신청 목록
GET {{baseUrl}}/instructor-applications/me?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 강사 신청 상세
GET {{baseUrl}}/instructor-applications/{{applicationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 강사 신청 승인
POST {{baseUrl}}/instructor-applications/{{applicationId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 강사 신청 거절
POST {{baseUrl}}/instructor-applications/{{applicationId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "rejectionReason": "서류 미비"
}

### 사용자 목록 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?page=0&size=20&status=ACTIVE&sort=createdAt,desc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 학생 목록 서버 필터 — 성별·수강·최근 접속·가입일 (dabaeum-issues #52, 구·군은 #142 에서 뺐다)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?page=0&size=10&role=LEARNER&gender=FEMALE&hasEnrollment=false&lastLogin=OVER_90&createdFrom=2026-01-01&createdTo=2026-10-23&sort=lastLoginAt,desc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 요약 카드 — 조건만 주고 size=1 로 page.totalElements 를 읽는다
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?page=0&size=1&role=LEARNER&status=DORMANT
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 사용자 생성
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "홍길동",
  "email": "hong@example.com",
  "phone": "010-1234-5678",
  "birthDate": "1990-01-15",
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### 내 사용자 정보 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 내 사용자 정보 수정 — 학습자 관심 분야: interestCodes 생략=그대로, []=지우고 동의 철회. 동의 전 회원이 값을 넣으려면 agreedToInterest true (#142)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "홍길동",
  "phone": "010-1234-5678",
  "interestCodes": ["TSIX_040000"],
  "agreedToInterest": true
}

### 사용자 상세 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 사용자 상태 변경
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### =========================
### Identity & Role
### =========================

### 사용자 Identity 목록
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/identities
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Identity 연결
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/identities
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "provider": "LOCAL",
  "providerSubject": "hong@example.com",
  "externalDid": null,
  "verified": true
}

### Identity 상세
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/identities/{{identityId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 사용자 역할 목록
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 역할 부여
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "role": "LEARNER",
  "institutionId": null
}

### 역할 상세
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/roles/{{roleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### =========================
### Course
### =========================

### 과정 목록 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses?page=0&size=20&sort=createdAt,desc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 과정 생성
POST {{baseUrl}}/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "institutionId": "{{institutionId}}",
  "courseCode": "DATA-101",
  "title": "데이터 분석 기초와 실무",
  "description": "파이썬 기반 데이터 분석 입문 과정",
  "classificationCode": "TSIX_030101",
  "educationType": "ONLINE",
  "startDate": "2026-09-01",
  "endDate": "2026-10-31",
  "recruitStartDate": "2026-08-01",
  "recruitEndDate": "2026-08-25",
  "capacity": 30,
  "location": null,
  "onlineUrl": "https://learn.example.com/data-101",
  "creditBankEligible": true,
  "creditValue": 3
}

### 과정 상세 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses/{{courseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 과정 수정
PUT {{baseUrl}}/courses/{{courseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "데이터 분석 기초와 실무",
  "capacity": 35,
  "status": "RECRUITING"
}

### 임시저장(DRAFT) 과정 삭제 — DRAFT 가 아니면 409 COURSE_STATUS_CONFLICT, 없으면 404 COURSE_NOT_FOUND (soft delete)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/courses/{{courseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 과정 게시
POST {{baseUrl}}/courses/{{courseId}}/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 과정 마감
POST {{baseUrl}}/courses/{{courseId}}/close
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 과정 강사 목록
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses/{{courseId}}/instructors
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 과정 강사 배정
POST {{baseUrl}}/courses/{{courseId}}/instructors
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "role": "MAIN"
}

### 과정 강사 역할 변경
PUT {{baseUrl}}/courses/{{courseId}}/instructors/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "role": "ASSISTANT"
}

### 과정 강사 배정 해제
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/courses/{{courseId}}/instructors/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### =========================
### Course Session
### =========================

### 회차 목록 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses/{{courseId}}/sessions?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 회차 생성
POST {{baseUrl}}/courses/{{courseId}}/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "sessionNo": 1,
  "startsAt": "2026-09-01T10:00:00+09:00",
  "endsAt": "2026-09-01T12:00:00+09:00",
  "location": "온라인",
  "attendanceOpensAt": "2026-09-01T09:50:00+09:00",
  "attendanceClosesAt": "2026-09-01T12:10:00+09:00",
  "status": "SCHEDULED"
}

### 회차 상세 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 회차 수정
PUT {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "status": "OPEN"
}

### =========================
### Enrollment
### =========================

### 수강신청 목록
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses/{{courseId}}/enrollments?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 수강신청 (본인)
POST {{baseUrl}}/courses/{{courseId}}/enrollments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "applicationType": "SELF"
}

### 기관 관리자용 학습자 정확 일치 조회 (중앙 #56 → #142, lookupInstitutionLearner) — name + birthDate + phone 셋 다 필수
# POST 본문 — 개인정보가 접근 로그에 남지 않게. 모르는 필드는 400. 이름은 앞뒤 공백 제외 일치, 휴대전화는 숫자만 비교
# 200 { userId, name } · 404 없음/불일치/같은 값 2명 이상/신청 불가 모두 같음
# 429 RATE_LIMITED(+Retry-After) — IP 분당 30회·계정 하루 200회·같은 휴대전화는 누가 조회하든 하루 10회
POST {{baseUrl}}/institutions/{{institutionId}}/learners/lookup
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "홍길동",
  "birthDate": "1990-01-15",
  "phone": "01012345678"
}

### 대리 수강신청
POST {{baseUrl}}/courses/{{courseId}}/proxy-enrollments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}"
}

### 수강신청 상세
GET {{baseUrl}}/enrollments/{{enrollmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 수강신청 승인
POST {{baseUrl}}/enrollments/{{enrollmentId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 수강신청 거절
POST {{baseUrl}}/enrollments/{{enrollmentId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "reason": "정원 초과"
}

### 수강신청 취소
POST {{baseUrl}}/enrollments/{{enrollmentId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 수강 철회
POST {{baseUrl}}/enrollments/{{enrollmentId}}/withdraw
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### =========================
### Attendance
### =========================

### QR 토큰 발급
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}/qr-token
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 학생 다대구 출석 세션 열기 (무인증 · local/dev) — token 은 attendUrl 의 t 값 그대로
POST {{baseUrl}}/attend-sessions
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "token": "{{attendQrToken}}"
}

### 학생 다대구 출석 결과 (무인증) — 앱 복귀·버튼에서만 호출, 폴링 금지
GET {{baseUrl}}/attend-sessions/{{attendId}}
Accept: application/json

### 출결 목록
GET {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}/attendance?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 출결 등록 (QR)
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}/attendance
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "enrollmentId": "{{enrollmentId}}",
  "attendanceMethod": "QR",
  "status": "PRESENT",
  "checkedAt": "2026-09-01T10:05:00+09:00",
  "source": "APP",
  "qrToken": "REPLACE_WITH_QR_TOKEN_AT_LEAST_32_CHARS_LONG________"
}

### 출결 상세
GET {{baseUrl}}/attendance/{{attendanceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 출결 보정
PUT {{baseUrl}}/attendance/{{attendanceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "status": "LATE",
  "reason": "교통 지연으로 인한 지각 처리"
}

### 출결 요약
GET {{baseUrl}}/enrollments/{{enrollmentId}}/attendance-summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### =========================
### Completion
### =========================

### 이수 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/enrollments/{{enrollmentId}}/completion
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 이수 평가
POST {{baseUrl}}/enrollments/{{enrollmentId}}/completion/evaluate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{idempotencyKey}}
Accept: application/json

### 이수 확정
POST {{baseUrl}}/enrollments/{{enrollmentId}}/completion/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{idempotencyKey}}-confirm
Accept: application/json

### =========================
### Credential
### =========================

### Credential 발급 요청
POST {{baseUrl}}/completions/{{completionId}}/credentials
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{idempotencyKey}}-credential
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "validUntil": "2029-12-31T23:59:59+09:00"
}

### Credential 상세
GET {{baseUrl}}/credentials/{{credentialId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 내 Credential 목록
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me/credentials?page=0&size=20&sort=createdAt,desc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### VC 문서 다운로드
GET {{baseUrl}}/credentials/{{credentialId}}/document
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/vc+jwt

### 사용자 Credential 목록
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/credentials?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Credential 폐기
POST {{baseUrl}}/credentials/{{credentialId}}/revoke
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{idempotencyKey}}-revoke
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "reason": "발급 정보 오류로 재발급 예정"
}

### Credential 재발급
POST {{baseUrl}}/credentials/{{credentialId}}/reissue
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{idempotencyKey}}-reissue
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "reason": "정보 수정 후 재발급",
  "validUntil": "2029-12-31T23:59:59+09:00"
}

### Credential 검증
POST {{baseUrl}}/credentials/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "credentialNo": "VC-2026-000001",
  "verificationType": "API",
  "requesterType": "INSTITUTION",
  "requesterId": "{{institutionId}}"
}

### Credential 검증 이력
GET {{baseUrl}}/credentials/{{credentialId}}/verifications?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### =========================
### Badge (향후 구현 예정 계약 포함)
### =========================

### Badge 수동 발급 — 정의로만 준다(badgeType·badgeName 은 400). 이미 가진 정의면 기존 배지, 사용 중지 정의는 422
POST {{baseUrl}}/credentials/{{credentialId}}/badges
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{idempotencyKey}}-badge
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "definitionId": "{{badgeDefinitionId}}",
  "courseId": "{{courseId}}"
}

### 학습배지 상세 — 단계(tierLevel·tierName)·이수기준·수혜자·발급기관·lastEvent 포함
GET {{baseUrl}}/badges/{{badgeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 학습배지 변동 이력 — 발급·갱신·취소·복구 + 사유, 최근 것부터
GET {{baseUrl}}/badges/{{badgeId}}/history
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### NFT 학습배지 현황 (PLATFORM_ADMIN) — q 는 이름 부분일치
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/badges?page=0&size=10&status=ISSUED&tierLevel=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 학습배지 폐기 (PLATFORM_ADMIN) — 사유 1~200자, 이미 폐기면 409 BADGE_CONFLICT, 폐기한 배지는 자동 복구 안 됨
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/badges/{{badgeId}}/revoke
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "reason": "테스트 배지 정리"
}

### 사용자 수강 내역 (PLATFORM_ADMIN)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/enrollments?page=0&size=100
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 배지 도감 (사용 중 정의, 인증 없음)
GET {{baseUrl}}/badge-definitions
Accept: application/json

### 배지 정의 생성 (PLATFORM_ADMIN) — rule: COURSE_COMPLETION(courseId | classificationCode) · CUMULATIVE(count, classificationCode?)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/badge-definitions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "code": "CULTURE_3",
  "name": "문화예술 3과목",
  "description": "문화예술교육 분야 강좌 세 개를 수료하면 받습니다.",
  "rule": { "type": "CUMULATIVE", "count": 3, "classificationCode": "TSIX_040000" }
}

### 배지 정의 수정 (PUT 통째 교체, code 무시) — 발급된 배지가 있으면 규칙 변경 409 BADGE_DEFINITION_IN_USE
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/badge-definitions/{{badgeDefinitionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "문화예술 3과목",
  "description": null,
  "imageFileId": null,
  "rule": { "type": "CUMULATIVE", "count": 3, "classificationCode": "TSIX_040000" }
}

